WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:14.133
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.834
[fzzt]

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:20.560
Bzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz!

00:00:21.103 --> 00:00:22.314
Bzzzz?

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:24.739
Wow, huh? No bees.

00:00:24.739 --> 00:00:26.510
I guess I was premature.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:27.689
What's this?

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:30.688
It looks like... alien rebar.

00:00:30.688 --> 00:00:35.147
It's really thick, but that would
make sense, what with the low gravity.

00:00:35.147 --> 00:00:37.063
Wow, these are hallways.

00:00:37.063 --> 00:00:42.173
So far, it looks like I made the right
choice coming here. That's a surprise.

00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:46.112
Okay, he doesn't see me. Let's
do this the economical way.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.112
Uh-oh.

00:00:47.112 --> 00:00:47.860
Wait...

00:00:48.663 --> 00:00:52.705
Oh, okay! You just don't give a fuck.

00:00:52.705 --> 00:00:56.317
Well, if you don't give a fuck,
I don't give a fuck.

00:00:56.317 --> 00:00:58.320
Hell, if you guys were this chill earlier,

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.220
I would've just assumed you worked at
Black Mesa. Like a burn victim or something.

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.922
Hm, more equipment.

00:01:04.922 --> 00:01:07.631
Wouldn't make sense for
somebody to drop this here.

00:01:07.631 --> 00:01:10.703
Yeah, I think it got scattered
in the process.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.301
Okay, time for a loyalty test.

00:01:13.301 --> 00:01:16.827
I need a boost and that's your
new job description, all right?

00:01:18.035 --> 00:01:18.649
Good--

00:01:18.649 --> 00:01:20.305
[vortigese]

00:01:20.305 --> 00:01:23.734
Hey! This is a privilege.
Don't forget that.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.711
[strange noises]

00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:29.284
And I keep hearing a monkey or
something making noises.

00:01:29.284 --> 00:01:31.849
I mean, it's obviously
not a real monkey,

00:01:31.849 --> 00:01:34.581
but is there that big a
difference around here?

00:01:34.581 --> 00:01:36.597
Now what is THIS?

00:01:36.597 --> 00:01:39.387
These look like integrated circuits!

00:01:39.387 --> 00:01:43.009
Doesn't do anything, but maybe
I've underestimated them.

00:01:43.009 --> 00:01:46.563
Or maybe they just stole it from
somewhere else because it looks valuable.

00:01:46.563 --> 00:01:47.906
It probably is.

00:01:47.906 --> 00:01:48.955
I don't know, though.

00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:52.341
This structure at least resembles
something professional-looking,

00:01:52.341 --> 00:01:53.995
like they have some sort of purpose

00:01:53.995 --> 00:01:58.542
instead of just running around in circles
on their islands making guttural noises.

00:01:58.542 --> 00:02:01.569
Yeah, we have lifts, barrels, lighting...

00:02:01.569 --> 00:02:05.192
This is some sort of
manufacturing or processing.

00:02:05.192 --> 00:02:09.230
They're still not wearing any clothes,
though, so I'm not THAT impressed.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:12.300
Yeah, I'm pretty sure
I can take this place over.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.620
It's ripe for colonization.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:19.464
I just need to find the leader, blow his
head off, then they'll start bowing to me.

00:02:19.464 --> 00:02:24.318
Okay, I'm not convinced what I'm
doing right now is a good idea,

00:02:24.318 --> 00:02:29.911
but there's literally no entrance. So,
were the workers born here or what?

00:02:29.911 --> 00:02:35.974
BLAHBLABLABLAHALBALAHRRARAARARARAAARARAAAA!

00:02:35.974 --> 00:02:38.818
[heavy gasping]

00:02:38.818 --> 00:02:43.452
MY MATTER DOES NOT
VIBRATE THE CORRECT WAY!

00:02:43.452 --> 00:02:45.393
NO MORE FORCEFIELDS!

00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:48.827
I AM NOT A BARREL!

00:02:50.415 --> 00:02:52.650
I NEVER WANTED TO BE A BARREL!

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.705
If I see another one of those fields,

00:02:54.705 --> 00:03:00.149
I'll calmly get down and tear apart this
entire room until I can disable the power.

00:03:00.149 --> 00:03:01.893
Uh oh. Okay, water!

00:03:02.345 --> 00:03:03.560
[underwater panicking]

00:03:04.485 --> 00:03:05.388
HOT!

00:03:05.388 --> 00:03:06.616
HOT WATER!

00:03:06.616 --> 00:03:08.743
WHERE ARE MY TOWELS?!

00:03:08.743 --> 00:03:10.979
YOU DIDN'T LAY ANY OUT!

00:03:10.979 --> 00:03:13.524
I'M HOLDING EVERYONE HERE RESPONSIBLE!

00:03:13.524 --> 00:03:16.569
AND I DON'T WANT TO HEAR ANY
CRAP ABOUT THIS BEING A FACTORY;

00:03:16.569 --> 00:03:18.880
IT'S A SPA IF I SAY IT'S A SPA!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.426
AH!

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.997
YOU'RE UNDER NEW MANAGEMENT NOW!

00:03:22.997 --> 00:03:26.691
IT'S ONLY MY FIRST DAY HERE AND
I'M ALREADY SEEING DOZENS OF THINGS

00:03:26.691 --> 00:03:28.260
WE'RE GOING TO NEED TO CHANGE!

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.685
YOU'RE EITHER WITH MORE OR I'M GOING
TO HAVE TO KILL YOU! SO PICK A SIDE!

00:03:32.685 --> 00:03:34.551
HEY! I'M TALKING TO YOU!

00:03:34.551 --> 00:03:37.729
THIS IS ABOUT YOUR FUTURE!
SO, WHICH IS IT?!

00:03:37.729 --> 00:03:38.917
[vortigaunt charging up]
FINE!

00:03:38.917 --> 00:03:40.851
I didn't even see you doing anything.

00:03:40.851 --> 00:03:44.124
I saw you standing in a corner
acting like you're busy.

00:03:44.124 --> 00:03:45.941
I was more impressed by the last room

00:03:45.941 --> 00:03:48.990
where there was one guy working
and five standing around.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.304
That's how we do it back on Earth, too.

00:03:51.304 --> 00:03:53.217
Looks like I found my predecessor.

00:03:53.217 --> 00:03:55.259
What happened? The workers kill him?

00:03:55.259 --> 00:03:58.655
Oh, yeah. There's going to be a
lot of restructuring around here.

00:03:58.655 --> 00:04:01.337
It would help if I knew what
was in these barrels,

00:04:01.337 --> 00:04:04.005
or what any of this does, really.

00:04:04.005 --> 00:04:06.561
Not a problem. I'll find out.

00:04:06.561 --> 00:04:08.109
It would just be easier...

00:04:08.109 --> 00:04:09.790
[panting]
...for everyone involved...

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.319
...if someone told me.

00:04:11.319 --> 00:04:13.601
[vortigaunt charging up]
It's not laundry detergent.

00:04:13.601 --> 00:04:15.411
You're not helping!

00:04:15.411 --> 00:04:18.960
This is NOT what cooperation sounds like!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.164
Ah, the foreman.

00:04:21.009 --> 00:04:21.980
Ah, shit!

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.678
YAAAH!

00:04:22.678 --> 00:04:25.572
I DON'T CARE ABOUT YOUR STUPID POLICIES!

00:04:26.464 --> 00:04:28.173
Oh, is that gonna crush him?

00:04:28.173 --> 00:04:29.343
Aww...

00:04:30.184 --> 00:04:33.831
You've been downsized... with a bullet.

00:04:33.831 --> 00:04:35.334
Yeah, you too!

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:40.056
In fact, I think company policy should be
to just run away from me if you see me.

00:04:41.904 --> 00:04:44.974
That would simplify my life for
the next few weeks.

00:04:44.974 --> 00:04:48.373
I think these fliers must be
the dominant species here.

00:04:48.373 --> 00:04:51.438
How the hell else would anything
get around between these islands?

00:04:51.438 --> 00:04:55.839
Also, their heads seem disproportionately
large compared to the rest of their body.

00:04:55.839 --> 00:04:58.685
Maybe they need that space for
more developed brains.

00:04:58.685 --> 00:05:03.131
Then again, maybe they just puff up
their heads to float around like balloons.

00:05:03.131 --> 00:05:06.618
At some point, I'm just going to
have to call it quits with teleporting

00:05:06.618 --> 00:05:07.981
once I've run out of ammo.

00:05:09.026 --> 00:05:11.418
But that day has not come yet.

00:05:11.418 --> 00:05:12.326
[vortigaunt charging up]

00:05:13.278 --> 00:05:16.059
Ooh, that one was a little fast.
Did I get him?

00:05:17.074 --> 00:05:19.716
Well, I'm sure he'll let me
know if I didn't.

00:05:19.716 --> 00:05:21.868
Ah, more technology.

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:25.775
So, these aliens are at the cusp
of industrial revolution development?

00:05:25.775 --> 00:05:29.245
Except they have teleporters and
forcefields. What the fuck?

00:05:29.245 --> 00:05:32.673
But they don't have clothes or tools or...

00:05:32.673 --> 00:05:36.139
Okay, is this guy hostile?
Eh, why take a chance?

00:05:37.123 --> 00:05:38.519
Well, he's not now.

00:05:38.519 --> 00:05:42.161
All right, this gap isn't quite big
enough. I'm going to move this junk.

00:05:42.161 --> 00:05:43.958
It's heavy, too.

00:05:43.958 --> 00:05:47.384
SHIT POPPERS! HOW DID THAT
THING GET INSIDE A BARREL?!

00:05:47.384 --> 00:05:51.116
OH, GREAT! THERE'S THE
STORE GREETER! FUCK OFF!

00:05:51.116 --> 00:05:52.706
LEAVE ME ALONE!

00:05:52.706 --> 00:05:54.769
SHIT! THERE'S ANOTHER!

00:05:54.769 --> 00:05:57.640
YOUR SERVICES ARE NOT REQUIRED!

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:01.748
So, they're manufacturing soldiers?!
That's what's in the barrels?!

00:06:01.748 --> 00:06:04.253
Why?! So they can shoot bees?!

00:06:04.253 --> 00:06:08.807
Have they done a cost-benefit analysis
of that instead of just making guns?

00:06:08.807 --> 00:06:10.602
Or maybe they have different criteria

00:06:10.602 --> 00:06:12.622
[vortigaunt charging up]
like which one makes nicer sounds.

00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:13.350
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.412
RRH!

00:06:14.412 --> 00:06:16.218
THAT IS IT!

00:06:16.218 --> 00:06:21.220
I'M GETTING SICK AND TIRED OF BEING
SHOT WITH ELECTRICITY OVER AND OVER!

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:24.947
EVEN ON MY WORST DATES, I NEVER
GOT SHOCKED THIS MUCH!

00:06:24.947 --> 00:06:26.474
GOOD! GUTS!

00:06:26.474 --> 00:06:28.893
Fucking low-gravity whiffle shot...

00:06:29.926 --> 00:06:31.799
PLAY CATCH, ASSHOLE!

00:06:31.799 --> 00:06:33.024
YOU MISSED! PICK IT UP!

00:06:33.024 --> 00:06:33.895
Eh, shit...

00:06:33.895 --> 00:06:38.226
OKAY, ENOUGH OF THIS BOUNCING HAPPY
FUN TIME; I'M NOT COMMUNICATING CLEARLY!

00:06:39.456 --> 00:06:40.560
STEP RIGHT UP!

00:06:42.252 --> 00:06:43.426
NICE CATCH!

00:06:46.904 --> 00:06:48.827
NOW, DON'T CROWD! AHH!

00:06:52.094 --> 00:06:56.726
THIS MUST BE THE MEAT STORAGE
FACILITY! DON'T WORRY, WE'LL FILL IT UP!

00:06:57.783 --> 00:06:58.780
Hiding!

00:06:58.780 --> 00:06:59.216
AH!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:04.215
YEAH, I'LL STACK THIS PLACE TO THE
CEILING WITH ALIEN GUTS IF I HAVE TO!

00:07:04.215 --> 00:07:05.092
[alien controller call]
What's that?!

00:07:06.488 --> 00:07:07.159
AH!

00:07:07.962 --> 00:07:08.671
Rr!

00:07:09.285 --> 00:07:14.759
Satchel charges! Yeah, yeah I
found a use for them last time, didn't I?

00:07:14.759 --> 00:07:17.943
Oh, no way! More grenade rounds!

00:07:17.943 --> 00:07:21.379
Yeah, we were just DUMPING
researchers here.

00:07:21.379 --> 00:07:23.684
What was the plan to get them back?

00:07:23.684 --> 00:07:28.452
I mean, there had to be SOME plan. You
would lose money on the equipment alone.

00:07:28.452 --> 00:07:31.224
I mean guided rockets
aren't exactly cheap.

00:07:31.224 --> 00:07:31.904
Okay...

00:07:33.424 --> 00:07:35.693
Ah, damn. I can do this.

00:07:37.281 --> 00:07:39.188
Damn! It's too slick!

00:07:39.188 --> 00:07:43.197
Well, I feel like I've been given
the tools to solve this problem.

00:07:43.197 --> 00:07:46.733
Maybe I'll get lucky and it'll
take out the support column, too.

00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:48.774
There's nothing of value here at all.

00:07:48.774 --> 00:07:49.623
[explosion]

00:07:49.623 --> 00:07:52.735
And just in case, let's be safe.

00:07:52.735 --> 00:07:53.660
God dammit!

00:07:56.544 --> 00:07:58.709
Fucking monsters in barrels.

00:07:58.709 --> 00:08:02.229
Hey, that means the movie
Phantasm was semi-accurate.

00:08:02.229 --> 00:08:04.744
NO, GO AND RUN, YOU HAD THE RIGHT IDEA!

00:08:04.744 --> 00:08:06.700
[vortigaunt charging up]
Christ, you having a meeting in here?

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:07.397
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:08:08.641 --> 00:08:10.623
THAT'LL CLIP YOUR WINGS!

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:12.149
[vortigaunt charging up]
SHOULD'VE RELOADED SOONER!

00:08:12.149 --> 00:08:13.152
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:08:13.152 --> 00:08:14.377
[vortigaunt charging up]

00:08:14.377 --> 00:08:15.411
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:08:16.774 --> 00:08:18.091
Okay!

00:08:18.091 --> 00:08:20.293
Quiet time has now started,

00:08:20.293 --> 00:08:26.185
so please use your inside voice if you need
to be a psychotic menace to all that is good.

00:08:26.185 --> 00:08:30.059
Okay, I don't see a
passageway but THIS is useful.

00:08:31.681 --> 00:08:34.006
Oh, yeah, this guy was loaded.

00:08:34.006 --> 00:08:36.726
Let's double check, does this...?

00:08:37.986 --> 00:08:39.876
Yeah, nothing.

00:08:39.876 --> 00:08:41.873
So, this is a dead end.

00:08:41.873 --> 00:08:44.972
Well... I know what this is.

00:08:44.972 --> 00:08:48.934
This is a big-screen TV
if I ever saw one.

00:08:48.934 --> 00:08:52.531
It has protective doors, I just
need to get them off.

00:08:52.531 --> 00:08:54.992
Well, I'm going to figure this out.

00:08:57.774 --> 00:09:01.711
I know alien TV has to be better
than daytime television.

00:09:01.711 --> 00:09:04.409
Aliens don't need to babysit
retired people.

